Package: charport
Title: Interconnect for ALTREP Character Vector Backends
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Date: 2026-06-10
Authors@R: c(
    person("Travers", "Ching", email = "traversc@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")))
Maintainer: Travers Ching <traversc@gmail.com>
Description: Infrastructure for ALTREP character vectors: a reference
    ALTREP string class ('charvec') backed by stable memory slices with a
    parallel-constructible builder, a runtime registration interface for
    third-party ALTREP string backends, and a common zero-copy read path
    so consumer packages can iterate over any character vector with a
    single code path. Writable interop (mutating another package's
    backend through a generic interface) is out of scope.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Suggests:
    knitr, rmarkdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Biarch: true
Depends: R (>= 3.6.0)
URL: https://github.com/traversc/charport
BugReports: https://github.com/traversc/charport/issues
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
